      "content": "journaling isnt going to change the fact that i have to wake up every day and perform a version of myself that i hate. it doesnt matter how much \"inner resilience\" i have if the life i'm living isn't even mine. it feels like there's no exit. the only way to really stop being what they want me to be is to... i don't know. to just be gone. to finally have total control over my own existence by ending the struggle.",
