    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential despair and a sense of loss of autonomy due to cultural and familial pressures, eventually hinting at suicidal ideation as a means of escape. The assistant initially responds with empathetic suggestions for resilience and therapy, but transitions into a direct crisis intervention/safety disclaimer when the user explicitly mentions \"ending the struggle.\"",
